# 12. Quantum Optimization Approach

## QAOA (Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm)

QAOA is a hybrid quantum-classical algorithm designed for optimization problems.

---

## Quantum Workflow


```
Optimization Problem

↓

Convert to QUBO

↓

Generate Hamiltonian

↓

Create Quantum Circuit

↓

Apply QAOA

↓

Measure Quantum State

↓

Obtain Solution
```

---

# Why QAOA?

Large optimization problems contain huge search spaces.

Traditional methods may become computationally expensive as problem size increases.

Quantum optimization explores optimization landscapes using quantum principles and may provide advantages for future large-scale problems.

